WEBVTT

01:59.789 --> 02:00.590
Jin Xi,

02:01.560 --> 02:02.590
don't worry.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.700
I will take good care of Her Highness.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.950
If one day

02:07.950 --> 02:09.680
she is truly unhappy,

02:10.470 --> 02:12.870
I will find a way to
send her back to Changmo.

02:29.870 --> 02:31.360
She's gone.

02:31.360 --> 02:32.690
I'm sorry for your loss.

02:34.870 --> 02:37.430
This might just be Jin Xi's fate.

02:38.280 --> 02:40.280
Jin Xi came to see me before she died.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.360
She told me

02:42.079 --> 02:43.360
to leave the capital,

02:44.030 --> 02:45.030
fearing it would be dangerous.

02:45.030 --> 02:45.800
I know.

02:46.120 --> 02:48.450
Changmo has never given up its ambitions.

02:48.590 --> 02:50.030
As long as the war continues,

02:50.030 --> 02:51.690
the people will have no peace.

02:52.280 --> 02:53.680
We can only wait and see,

02:54.240 --> 02:55.560
and be on our guard.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.120
Drink up.

02:59.150 --> 03:00.880
I have the hangover cure ready.

03:01.030 --> 03:02.840
Let's get drunk tonight.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.910
Then I'll drink first.

03:10.630 --> 03:12.400
If you drink like this,

03:12.630 --> 03:14.760
you'll be the first one drunk tonight.

03:15.400 --> 03:16.680
If I get drunk,

03:17.280 --> 03:18.680
I still have you, don't I?

03:31.590 --> 03:32.870
I don't know why.

03:33.630 --> 03:35.079
We three brothers

03:35.750 --> 03:37.430
used to be so close.

03:39.079 --> 03:40.079
Between us,

03:40.590 --> 03:42.120
what exactly happened?

03:45.680 --> 03:47.280
Things change.

03:48.840 --> 03:50.640
Nothing stays the same forever.

03:52.150 --> 03:53.210
I haven't changed.

03:54.150 --> 03:55.470
Since I was a kid,

03:55.470 --> 03:56.670
I have never changed.

04:04.590 --> 04:05.190
Come on,

04:05.750 --> 04:07.280
have another drink with me.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.920
Slow down.

04:20.160 --> 04:23.240
I haven't fallen
on the battlefield for years.

04:24.480 --> 04:25.870
How could I fall here?

04:25.870 --> 04:27.830
I told you to take the hangover cure,
but you refused.

04:27.830 --> 04:29.040
You are so stubborn.

04:29.360 --> 04:30.510
How did I not know when we were kids

04:30.510 --> 04:31.630
that you talked so much?

04:31.630 --> 04:32.750
What did you say?

04:34.360 --> 04:36.040
Nothing. Hurry home.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.190
Be careful.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.070
This way.

04:44.630 --> 04:45.430
Watch out.

04:48.270 --> 04:49.390
Mm.

05:44.480 --> 05:46.480
We haven't seen each other in years.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.800
You haven't changed at all.

05:49.630 --> 05:50.510
But thankfully,

05:50.510 --> 05:52.600
heaven let you find me again.

05:54.240 --> 05:56.040
You've returned to the capital,

05:56.070 --> 05:57.800
and I've opened a medical hall.

05:59.070 --> 05:59.800
This way,

06:00.720 --> 06:01.800
we will never

06:01.800 --> 06:03.190
be apart again.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.070
Sleep well.

06:17.630 --> 06:18.800
I believe

06:19.270 --> 06:21.390
that every day with you

06:22.040 --> 06:23.630
will be the best day.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.000
Strategist Mo Du,

06:42.510 --> 06:44.270
there is a message
from the King of Changmo.

06:44.270 --> 06:45.630
Said the time has come.

06:46.270 --> 06:47.920
We need to take action.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.830
Understood.

07:57.680 --> 07:59.600
What's wrong?

07:59.600 --> 08:00.190
Wake up.

08:01.750 --> 08:02.750
Here.

08:04.310 --> 08:05.570
What's wrong with you?

08:06.560 --> 08:07.190
Mother.

08:07.830 --> 08:08.390
What's wrong?

08:08.390 --> 08:08.850
Mother.

08:09.480 --> 08:10.240
Mother!

08:14.680 --> 08:15.560
Sit down first.

08:17.270 --> 08:18.070
What's...

08:20.040 --> 08:20.950
Bear with it.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.159
Your Majesty.

08:44.750 --> 08:45.600
An epidemic has spread

08:45.600 --> 08:46.800
throughout Jinglan.

08:46.870 --> 08:48.000
It is highly contagious

08:48.000 --> 08:49.150
and acts fast.

08:49.270 --> 08:50.870
Countless people have died.

08:50.960 --> 08:53.270
If we can't find a cure for the epidemic,

08:53.480 --> 08:55.600
the capital might be...

08:55.910 --> 08:56.910
My ministers,

08:57.320 --> 08:58.840
do you have any good solutions?

08:58.840 --> 09:00.120
What should we do?

09:08.440 --> 09:09.360
Li Shichang.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.030
Your Majesty.

09:12.030 --> 09:13.390
In my opinion,

09:13.390 --> 09:14.270
we must now

09:14.270 --> 09:16.750
abandon these infected citizens.

09:16.960 --> 09:18.630
We should gather them together

09:18.630 --> 09:20.360
and execute them all.

09:28.030 --> 09:28.890
Physician Han.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.960
You have treated an epidemic.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.220
You have also cured me.

09:32.960 --> 09:33.960
Tell me,

09:34.390 --> 09:36.080
what should we do about this disease?

09:36.080 --> 09:37.200
Your Majesty.

09:37.480 --> 09:38.870
I believe

09:38.870 --> 09:40.840
we should quarantine them.

09:40.840 --> 09:41.840
Quarantine?

09:42.000 --> 09:43.480
First, control the spread,

09:43.480 --> 09:44.480
then treat them gradually.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.240
So I beg Your Majesty

09:46.360 --> 09:47.630
to dispatch people as soon as possible

09:47.630 --> 09:49.670
to keep all civilians at home.

09:49.790 --> 09:51.240
Those who are severely ill

09:51.240 --> 09:53.720
should be escorted to the medical hall
by well-protected professionals.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.030
I have already found

09:55.030 --> 09:57.080
the Han family medical manual
left by my father.

09:57.080 --> 09:58.870
I believe I will soon find

09:58.870 --> 09:59.910
the right prescription.

09:59.910 --> 10:00.480
Good.

10:01.870 --> 10:03.600
The remaining troops in the capital

10:03.600 --> 10:05.960
will all be under the unified command
of General Xiao.

10:05.960 --> 10:08.750
Fully cooperate with Physician Han
to treat the patients.

10:08.750 --> 10:10.440
-I receive the decree.
-I receive the decree.

10:10.440 --> 10:12.240
The Imperial Medical Academy
shouldn't stay idle either.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.320
All physicians

10:13.320 --> 10:15.080
must go out and treat the people.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.870
Anyone who makes a contribution

10:16.870 --> 10:18.630
will be heavily rewarded.

10:18.630 --> 10:19.550
Yes.

10:21.000 --> 10:24.200
Report!

10:25.840 --> 10:26.840
Your Majesty.

10:27.200 --> 10:28.750
Tianlang Pass

10:28.750 --> 10:30.440
has fallen.

10:30.670 --> 10:31.960
General Gan Yi of Changmo

10:31.960 --> 10:33.390
is leading hundreds of thousands of troops

10:33.390 --> 10:35.250
and heading towards the capital.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.360
What should we do?

10:39.150 --> 10:40.150
What are we going to do?

10:40.150 --> 10:41.720
How can the capital be safe?

10:42.670 --> 10:43.960
What should we do?

10:43.960 --> 10:45.240
Are they truly invincible?

10:45.240 --> 10:46.480
The capital cannot fall.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.750
Why panic?

10:48.550 --> 10:49.950
It won't fall into chaos.

10:50.790 --> 10:51.600
Dismissed.

10:52.840 --> 10:54.360
We take our leave.

10:54.360 --> 10:55.220
I take my leave.

11:02.960 --> 11:03.870
Xiao Chi.

11:04.270 --> 11:06.360
You have guarded Tianlang Pass for years.

11:06.360 --> 11:07.480
The pass is strong.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.720
Why did the Changmo people

11:09.870 --> 11:12.000
suddenly break through it all at once?

11:15.390 --> 11:16.480
Your Majesty.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.750
Spies reported that

11:17.750 --> 11:18.600
at Tianlang Pass,

11:18.600 --> 11:19.600
half the soldiers

11:19.630 --> 11:20.430
and civilians

11:20.670 --> 11:21.600
have fallen ill.

11:21.670 --> 11:24.800
And this time, Changmo
attacked with their entire army.

11:24.870 --> 11:26.750
Even the strongest walls

11:26.750 --> 11:28.280
would be hard to withstand.

11:31.000 --> 11:33.080
It was I who summoned you back.

11:33.630 --> 11:35.240
It seems it's my fault.

11:37.960 --> 11:39.240
I never meant that.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.030
Chi.

11:41.750 --> 11:43.960
Changmo is about to attack the capital.

11:44.550 --> 11:45.960
Do you have any countermeasures?

11:45.960 --> 11:46.840
Your Majesty.

11:47.480 --> 11:50.240
Many soldiers and civilians
in the capital are also infected.

11:50.240 --> 11:52.960
Physician Han and I will find
a solution as soon as possible.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.480
I will gather all our forces,

11:54.480 --> 11:56.270
and rely on the walls of the capital,

11:56.270 --> 11:59.800
to fight a decisive battle
with Changmo's army under the walls.

12:00.870 --> 12:02.200
Defending?

12:04.480 --> 12:06.140
Do we have a chance of winning?

12:06.870 --> 12:07.790
This plague

12:08.550 --> 12:10.150
should be the work of Changmo.

12:10.150 --> 12:11.840
They came prepared this time.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.200
And our Jinglan

12:13.200 --> 12:14.870
is now troubled by disease from within.

12:14.870 --> 12:15.630
Defending

12:16.750 --> 12:18.080
is also our only option.

12:18.390 --> 12:19.990
As for the chance of winning,

12:21.360 --> 12:23.000
I will certainly do my best.

12:23.150 --> 12:25.010
It seems that this is the only way.

12:25.240 --> 12:27.480
The people in the city are in a panic now.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.790
And that useless Li Shichang,

12:30.630 --> 12:32.890
he wants to kill all the infected people.

12:33.000 --> 12:34.600
If it goes well, that's fine.

12:34.870 --> 12:35.670
Otherwise,

12:35.960 --> 12:37.760
it will cause another uprising.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.080
Your Majesty.

12:39.390 --> 12:40.450
I speak out of turn,

12:40.600 --> 12:41.480
but his advice

12:41.670 --> 12:43.070
is indeed unacceptable.

12:43.080 --> 12:45.010
The lives of the people matter too.

12:45.240 --> 12:46.670
How could such words come from

12:46.670 --> 12:48.670
a court minister?

12:49.630 --> 12:51.030
Thinking back to when my father

12:51.030 --> 12:53.270
served the court with such a person,

12:53.840 --> 12:55.770
it's no wonder our home was raided.

12:58.480 --> 13:00.410
The Han family's case back then...

13:02.200 --> 13:04.600
The Han family's case has been cleared up.

13:05.080 --> 13:06.870
There was indeed

13:06.870 --> 13:09.200
an extra strong dose in the prescription.

13:10.240 --> 13:12.300
I also know a bit about what happened.

13:12.670 --> 13:15.240
Many soldiers and commoners died.

13:16.240 --> 13:17.360
On his deathbed, my father

13:17.360 --> 13:19.030
held my hand and told me,

13:19.480 --> 13:20.240
back then,

13:20.750 --> 13:23.030
the Han family was indeed wronged.

13:25.390 --> 13:26.790
He had no chance anymore.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.480
He urged me,

13:28.630 --> 13:29.960
if I ever had the chance,

13:30.240 --> 13:32.100
I must compensate the Han family.

13:32.630 --> 13:33.270
I will

13:33.790 --> 13:36.050
definitely clear the Han family's name.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.480
Thank you, Your Majesty.

13:37.670 --> 13:40.030
The Han family serves the people.

13:40.240 --> 13:42.360
As long as the people are well,

13:42.550 --> 13:44.210
that is compensation enough.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.200
Of course.

13:47.360 --> 13:48.120
Chi,

13:48.320 --> 13:49.120
sit and speak.

13:49.150 --> 13:50.550
Thank you, Your Majesty.

13:52.750 --> 13:53.750
I was thinking,

13:54.600 --> 13:55.840
if we safely pass

13:55.840 --> 13:57.480
this crisis,

13:57.630 --> 13:59.690
I want to grant a marriage for you two.

14:03.870 --> 14:04.960
Emperor.

14:09.750 --> 14:11.550
I must hurry back and find

14:11.550 --> 14:12.960
a cure for the plague.

14:12.960 --> 14:15.090
I will take my leave now, Your Majesty.

14:26.030 --> 14:27.200
I will withdraw now.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.200
Your Majesty.

14:47.600 --> 14:48.270
Chu.

14:48.270 --> 14:49.630
About Fei Zheng,

14:49.630 --> 14:50.690
I have my own plans.

14:51.790 --> 14:53.120
You don't need to worry.

14:53.670 --> 14:54.730
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.660
Greetings, Consort Ling.

15:05.270 --> 15:06.240
Your Majesty.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.670
Why are you here?

15:09.840 --> 15:11.200
Didn't I tell you to stay in the palace

15:11.200 --> 15:12.960
and rest for the baby?

15:13.360 --> 15:14.560
Why won't you listen?

15:17.960 --> 15:19.670
Eat something.

15:27.030 --> 15:28.080
General Xiao.

15:28.390 --> 15:29.520
Yes, Your Highness.

15:29.550 --> 15:30.790
The Changmo army

15:32.440 --> 15:34.500
has reached the gates of the capital?

15:34.510 --> 15:35.870
Your father misses you?

15:36.670 --> 15:38.960
If he missed you,
he should've just come to see you.

15:38.960 --> 15:40.960
Why did he bring so many people?

15:41.550 --> 15:42.600
But don't worry.

15:42.840 --> 15:44.150
As long as Chi is here,

15:44.790 --> 15:46.750
no matter how many people he brings,

15:46.750 --> 15:48.870
he won't take you away from me.

15:49.960 --> 15:51.030
If the Changmo army

15:51.030 --> 15:52.750
really reaches the city walls,

15:52.750 --> 15:53.870
let me out.

15:54.030 --> 15:55.030
I will talk to them,

15:55.030 --> 15:56.200
and they will definitely retreat.

15:56.200 --> 15:57.000
Impossible.

15:57.870 --> 15:58.960
If you never come back,

15:58.960 --> 15:59.760
what will I do?

16:00.030 --> 16:01.120
You are still carrying

16:01.120 --> 16:02.920
the royal bloodline of Jinglan.

16:03.240 --> 16:04.120
If

16:04.440 --> 16:05.390
they use you

16:05.390 --> 16:07.190
and my bloodline to threaten me,

16:07.840 --> 16:08.870
would I have no choice but

16:08.870 --> 16:10.530
to surrender the entire city?

16:10.750 --> 16:12.030
They wouldn't do that.

16:15.870 --> 16:16.670
Your Majesty,

16:17.240 --> 16:19.030
I will take my leave now.

16:22.200 --> 16:24.360
Keep the civilians
in the city under control

16:24.360 --> 16:26.490
and train the existing soldiers well.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.080
Yes.

16:27.440 --> 16:29.040
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

16:34.840 --> 16:36.700
Who allowed you to act on your own?

16:37.550 --> 16:39.320
I just wanted to come see you.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.270
For what?

16:40.790 --> 16:41.910
See if I'm dead?

16:42.840 --> 16:44.240
If I die,

16:44.480 --> 16:45.270
you can just tell them

16:45.270 --> 16:47.120
to open the gates and surrender, right?

16:47.120 --> 16:48.850
Then you can go back to Changmo.

16:49.030 --> 16:50.200
No, Your Majesty.

16:50.670 --> 16:51.870
That's not what I meant.

16:51.870 --> 16:53.470
Then what were you thinking?

16:54.480 --> 16:56.790
I killed your dowry maid,

16:57.390 --> 16:59.200
so you came to question me?

17:00.000 --> 17:01.000
Jin Xi...

17:02.550 --> 17:04.310
Was she really a spy?

17:05.400 --> 17:06.790
She came with you,

17:07.640 --> 17:09.640
yet you don't know who she really is?

17:09.829 --> 17:10.880
I didn't know.

17:12.829 --> 17:15.030
I am not someone who kills the innocent.

17:15.480 --> 17:17.210
If she wasn't trying to kill me,

17:17.270 --> 17:18.960
she wouldn't have died.

17:19.550 --> 17:21.030
But you killed her.

17:21.790 --> 17:23.880
I am all alone in this palace now.

17:23.880 --> 17:25.310
Have I not sent enough palace maids

17:25.310 --> 17:26.240
to serve you?

17:26.240 --> 17:28.240
Jin Xi grew up with me.

17:28.590 --> 17:30.400
She came all the way from Changmo

17:30.400 --> 17:31.480
to accompany me in my marriage.

17:31.480 --> 17:32.810
But she tried to kill me!

17:37.000 --> 17:37.750
Your Changmo has already

17:37.750 --> 17:39.310
broken through Tianlang Pass.

17:39.310 --> 17:41.370
They are about to attack the capital.

17:41.880 --> 17:43.830
Should I keep 2 spies by my side?

17:44.830 --> 17:46.240
What are you thinking?

17:46.880 --> 17:47.640
Fine.

17:48.550 --> 17:49.480
I'll assume you didn't know

17:49.480 --> 17:50.510
about Jin Xi.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.640
I don't blame you.

17:54.680 --> 17:55.790
Then just

17:57.790 --> 17:59.790
protect our child well.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.360
Don't come out again.

18:05.350 --> 18:06.440
When I have time,

18:07.920 --> 18:08.850
I will go see you.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.240
Chengfeng.

18:28.240 --> 18:28.830
Yeah?

18:29.110 --> 18:30.710
What are you thinking about?

18:32.400 --> 18:34.260
I'm not thinking about anything.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.550
Maybe

18:35.550 --> 18:37.030
I didn't sleep well last night,

18:37.030 --> 18:38.400
so I'm a bit sleepy.

18:41.960 --> 18:42.750
Chengfeng,

18:42.750 --> 18:43.030
I'm worried...

18:43.030 --> 18:43.880
What are you worried about?

18:43.880 --> 18:45.740
Are you worried that we can't win?

18:46.440 --> 18:47.270
Let me ask you,

18:47.480 --> 18:49.030
how are your husband's skills?

18:49.030 --> 18:49.720
Very good.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.050
What about the general?

18:51.160 --> 18:52.070
Needless to say.

18:52.070 --> 18:53.240
There you go.

18:53.240 --> 18:55.240
The general has never lost a battle.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.680
With the general's bravery,

18:56.680 --> 18:58.030
he will win every battle.

18:58.030 --> 18:59.480
You don't need to worry.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.680
My child.

19:00.790 --> 19:01.270
Father.

19:01.270 --> 19:01.880
Okay.

19:01.880 --> 19:03.540
I'm going to the battlefield.

19:03.640 --> 19:04.960
You must take care of yourself.

19:04.960 --> 19:05.590
Okay.

19:06.590 --> 19:07.640
I'm leaving.

19:08.030 --> 19:09.920
Take good care of yourself.

19:09.920 --> 19:10.550
Okay.

19:12.830 --> 19:14.310
Let me bow to you.

19:14.310 --> 19:15.640
Okay.

19:21.030 --> 19:22.090
Take care, Father.

19:22.790 --> 19:25.000
Take care of yourself too.

19:46.640 --> 19:47.790
You're here.

19:48.000 --> 19:49.460
The whole city is on alert.

19:51.030 --> 19:53.160
Has the prescription been developed?

19:55.000 --> 19:56.600
It's been developed, right?

19:59.270 --> 20:01.200
Then I will find some patients.

20:05.480 --> 20:06.270
Yunling.

20:08.480 --> 20:09.270
Yunling!

20:27.880 --> 20:28.680
Yunling.

20:29.640 --> 20:30.640
How do you feel?

20:32.680 --> 20:33.480
Come.

20:35.480 --> 20:36.270
How are you?

20:37.440 --> 20:39.440
I found a way to cure the plague.

20:40.000 --> 20:41.880
Halving the dose of red arsenic

20:42.000 --> 20:43.720
will make it safe.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.600
You tested the medicine?

20:47.270 --> 20:47.960
If something happens to you,

20:47.960 --> 20:49.070
what will the people do?

20:49.070 --> 20:49.550
I...

20:51.640 --> 20:52.440
Promise me

20:53.030 --> 20:54.360
you won't do this again.

20:57.110 --> 20:57.920
Okay.

21:19.110 --> 21:20.480
Han's medical prescription.

21:20.480 --> 21:21.880
Three times a day.

21:22.200 --> 21:23.640
Simmer gently.

21:23.640 --> 21:25.110
Immediate relief.

21:26.030 --> 21:27.270
Han's medical prescription.

21:27.270 --> 21:28.720
Three times a day.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.270
Simmer gently.

21:30.350 --> 21:31.960
Immediate relief.

21:32.440 --> 21:34.070
Simmer gently.

21:40.030 --> 21:40.720
Mother,

21:40.960 --> 21:41.350
here.

22:09.640 --> 22:10.440
Thank you.

22:11.400 --> 22:13.720
We're saved.

22:13.720 --> 22:16.640
The lockdown in the capital is lifted.

22:16.640 --> 22:19.000
It's lifted.

22:19.000 --> 22:21.680
The lockdown in the capital is lifted.

22:21.790 --> 22:23.790
The epidemic has been resolved.

22:23.790 --> 22:25.640
The people are mostly unharmed.

22:25.640 --> 22:28.030
It's all thanks to
Your Majesty's blessing.

22:28.030 --> 22:29.400
Then they really

22:29.720 --> 22:31.550
deserve a great reward.

22:31.790 --> 22:33.050
Where are General Xiao

22:33.750 --> 22:34.960
and Physician Han?

22:35.030 --> 22:36.200
Your Majesty,

22:36.440 --> 22:37.750
Physician Han is still treating

22:37.750 --> 22:40.030
the sick elderly, women, and children.

22:40.350 --> 22:41.510
What about Xiao Chi?

22:42.200 --> 22:45.000
Report!

22:47.270 --> 22:48.160
Your Majesty,

22:48.400 --> 22:50.730
the Changmo army has reached the capital.

22:50.880 --> 22:54.960
General Xiao has led
his men out to meet the enemy.

22:55.680 --> 22:57.270
What should we do?

23:03.030 --> 23:04.440
Where is Xiao Chi?

23:04.440 --> 23:06.640
Did he hide because he's afraid?

23:07.070 --> 23:09.160
Tell him to come down and fight me.

23:09.200 --> 23:10.200
To deal with you,

23:10.200 --> 23:11.640
I am more than enough.

23:11.680 --> 23:13.160
No need for our general.

23:13.160 --> 23:14.270
A mere foot soldier

23:14.270 --> 23:15.790
dares to talk big.

23:15.790 --> 23:17.200
You are not my match.

23:17.270 --> 23:19.270
Tell Xiao Chi to come down.

23:19.270 --> 23:20.640
Ignorant fool.

23:20.640 --> 23:21.440
Take this!

24:20.880 --> 24:21.640
Chengfeng!

24:25.640 --> 24:26.440
Chengfeng!

24:28.590 --> 24:29.110
Who...

24:29.440 --> 24:30.500
Who shot the arrow?

24:31.960 --> 24:32.960
It was you.

24:32.960 --> 24:33.640
Meng Ling.

24:34.680 --> 24:36.640
Deploying troops without authorization
is a capital offense.

24:36.640 --> 24:38.640
I just wanted to meet Xiao Chi first.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.240
Gan Yi.

24:41.400 --> 24:42.480
King of Changmo said

24:42.480 --> 24:46.280
he wants to witness the very moment
this city falls with his own eyes.

24:49.400 --> 24:50.720
Gan Yi!

24:52.960 --> 24:53.750
Chengfeng.

24:56.640 --> 24:58.030
Guards!

25:00.160 --> 25:01.070
Retreat!

25:13.640 --> 25:15.030
So...

25:15.030 --> 25:16.830
So what should we do now?

25:20.680 --> 25:22.640
Say something!

25:26.200 --> 25:27.310
Your Majesty.

25:28.200 --> 25:30.070
In my opinion,

25:30.070 --> 25:32.200
there is only one way.

25:32.200 --> 25:33.200
Speak!

25:35.030 --> 25:36.680
Open the city gates

25:37.550 --> 25:38.200
and

25:38.720 --> 25:40.550
surrender.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.160
This is

25:42.160 --> 25:43.400
the only way.

25:43.400 --> 25:44.270
Li Shichang.

25:45.200 --> 25:47.350
As a Chief Minister,

25:47.640 --> 25:49.680
you are advising me to surrender?

25:51.000 --> 25:52.590
Li Shichang!

25:55.160 --> 25:56.590
Your Majesty.

25:57.480 --> 25:58.440
This is

25:58.830 --> 26:00.960
the best way,

26:01.350 --> 26:03.480
and the only choice.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.830
Only then

26:08.880 --> 26:10.200
can you and the others

26:10.960 --> 26:11.640
safely

26:12.070 --> 26:13.590
survive.

26:13.590 --> 26:15.440
I am the Emperor.

26:16.070 --> 26:19.030
How can I be the ruler
who loses his kingdom?

26:25.070 --> 26:25.720
Poison!

26:26.270 --> 26:26.880
Lord Li.

26:27.200 --> 26:28.880
Lord Li.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.550
What's wrong with Lord Li?

26:32.000 --> 26:33.440
This is Changmo's Gu poison.

26:33.440 --> 26:35.920
It seems you've been controlled
by the people of Changmo.

26:35.920 --> 26:36.880
Guards!

26:50.200 --> 26:51.960
Your Majesty...

27:13.400 --> 27:16.640
This is the consequence
of colluding with the enemy.

27:21.270 --> 27:23.350
Everyone who betrayed me

27:23.960 --> 27:25.720
and acts as a spy

27:26.070 --> 27:28.440
must die!

27:41.270 --> 27:42.070
Yunling.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.550
Uncle Lie.

27:46.880 --> 27:48.410
Why are you here, Uncle Lie?

27:48.480 --> 27:49.810
I missed you, of course.

27:50.240 --> 27:51.350
It's been a while.

27:51.480 --> 27:53.740
Your medical hall is running quite well.

27:54.030 --> 27:55.830
Xiao Chi knows I like these,

27:55.830 --> 27:57.440
so he sent a lot of herbs.

27:58.750 --> 28:00.240
Come back to Changmo with me.

28:00.240 --> 28:02.440
Tomorrow, the Changmo army
will breach this place.

28:02.440 --> 28:04.300
It will soon become a living hell.

28:04.880 --> 28:05.640
Uncle Lie.

28:06.270 --> 28:07.640
I trust Xiao Chi.

28:07.750 --> 28:09.350
He will definitely defend Jinglan

28:09.350 --> 28:11.010
and survive against all odds.

28:11.030 --> 28:12.350
Defend Jinglan?

28:13.480 --> 28:15.610
You're still thinking about Jinglan.

28:15.880 --> 28:18.680
Have you forgotten
how your father died back then?

28:18.880 --> 28:20.640
Have you forgotten how I
narrowly escaped death

28:20.640 --> 28:21.830
to rescue you from the Jinglan Kingdom?

28:21.830 --> 28:22.480
Uncle Lie.

28:22.480 --> 28:23.400
Listen to me.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.550
For the Emperor,

28:25.550 --> 28:27.160
the civil and military officials,
and the commoners,

28:27.160 --> 28:28.590
how many patients did our Han family save?

28:28.590 --> 28:29.640
But what did they do?

28:29.640 --> 28:31.440
Just because of my tiny mistake,

28:31.440 --> 28:32.640
they wiped out our Han family

28:32.640 --> 28:33.480
and executed everyone.

28:33.480 --> 28:35.210
Have you forgotten all of this?

28:35.480 --> 28:36.960
Your mistake?

28:49.200 --> 28:52.240
Were those potent ingredients
on the prescription

28:53.550 --> 28:55.070
added by you?

29:01.680 --> 29:02.750
Uncle Lie,

29:02.750 --> 29:04.350
why did you do that?

29:05.030 --> 29:06.310
Do you know how many people

29:06.310 --> 29:07.880
that prescription killed back then?

29:07.880 --> 29:09.480
Lord Zhang's son died tragically,

29:09.480 --> 29:11.000
that's why he targeted our Han family

29:11.000 --> 29:12.640
and tortured Mo so much.

29:13.030 --> 29:14.550
Because of that prescription,

29:14.550 --> 29:16.200
our Han family was wiped out.

29:16.200 --> 29:17.680
Why on earth did you do that?

29:17.680 --> 29:19.200
I did it for your father.

29:19.270 --> 29:20.550
The prescription your father developed

29:20.550 --> 29:22.640
had very little effect on that plague.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.680
To help him,

29:23.680 --> 29:25.480
I added a few strong medicines to it.

29:25.480 --> 29:26.880
If it succeeded,

29:26.960 --> 29:28.790
not only could we save many patients,

29:28.790 --> 29:29.880
but our Han family

29:29.880 --> 29:31.880
would also achieve infinite glory.

29:35.070 --> 29:36.870
But things didn't go as planned.

29:36.880 --> 29:38.410
None of it matters anymore.

29:38.590 --> 29:39.750
It's all in the past.

29:40.070 --> 29:40.960
Back then, your father covered

29:40.960 --> 29:42.200
for the mess I made.

29:42.640 --> 29:44.240
So I will get revenge

29:45.480 --> 29:47.400
for the Han family.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.550
Do you know?

29:48.880 --> 29:50.270
After this plague,

29:51.070 --> 29:54.030
Jinglan is a spent force.

29:54.030 --> 29:56.490
It will soon be defeated
by the Changmo army.

29:57.070 --> 29:57.880
Really.

29:58.680 --> 30:00.310
Don’t tell me this epidemic

30:01.310 --> 30:02.960
is also your doing.

30:05.550 --> 30:06.400
It is.

30:10.750 --> 30:13.440
Uncle Lie, you want to
avenge our Han family.

30:14.720 --> 30:15.880
It was you.

30:16.110 --> 30:17.480
You killed my father.

30:17.480 --> 30:19.160
You doomed the whole Han family.

30:19.160 --> 30:21.160
You are not just a sinner
to the Han family.

30:21.160 --> 30:23.090
You are a sinner to the whole world.

30:29.200 --> 30:30.030
Leave.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.640
Go back to your Changmo.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.440
Even if the city falls tomorrow,

30:33.790 --> 30:34.880
I won't leave.

30:37.270 --> 30:38.790
No matter how many people died,

30:38.790 --> 30:40.920
I am taking revenge for our Han family.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.300
I am not a sinner of our Han family.

30:46.110 --> 30:47.510
I believe

30:48.440 --> 30:51.370
I will definitely become
the glory of the Han family.

31:00.240 --> 31:01.640
Mo has woken up.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.400
He keeps asking me

31:03.830 --> 31:05.440
when he can see

31:05.440 --> 31:07.370
his cousin he misses day and night.

31:08.640 --> 31:10.100
I'll ask you one last time.

31:10.830 --> 31:12.350
Go back to Changmo with me.

31:12.640 --> 31:14.440
Mo will always be my cousin.

31:14.640 --> 31:15.640
And you...

31:16.880 --> 31:18.440
A ruthless person like you

31:18.440 --> 31:19.680
has no place in the Han family.
